# Copy to .env.local for local development. Both variables are optional.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the client bundle and are PUBLIC.
# Never put anything genuinely secret in one.

# Access key from https://web3forms.com. Register the key to hello@sljourney.com
# so enquiries are delivered there (Web3Forms free tier sends to the address the
# key is registered to; there is no per-form recipient override on the free plan).
# Enables email delivery of enquiries. Without it the form still works over
# WhatsApp, but loses its email fallback — a blocked popup means a lost lead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Leave unset for the custom domain (sljourney.com), which serves from the root.
# Only set this to deploy back to a project subpath, e.g. /sl_journeys for
# <user>.github.io/sl_journeys.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=
